{"articleNo":"475316","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=475316&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2024학년도 1학기 취업진로상담 교과목 시행안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2024.03.04","hit":"21472","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt; text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; letter-spacing: 2.3pt; font-size: 24pt;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; letter-spacing: 2.3pt; font-size: 24pt;\">학년도 1학기&nbsp;취업진로상담 교과목 시행안내</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; letter-spacing: 2.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 20pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">1. 개요<br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">-&nbsp;<b>2023학년 1학기 부터 시행(</b><b style=\"text-indent: -37pt;\">취업진로교육, 지도교수상담과 별개)</b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;-<b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;졸업요건에 반영되어 미이수시 졸업 불가능</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;- 졸업 전까지 4회 이수(건축학전공: 5회 이상)</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">동일 학기에는 교과목 상담을 1회 이상하더라도 &nbsp;1회 인정(1학기 상담 2회 진행&nbsp; → 교과목 상담 1회 이수)</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"6674\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;- 상담 또는 대체이수 중 선택하여 1년에 1회 참여 권장</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;<b>상담</b>: 대학일자리플러스센터 또는&nbsp;학생상담센터에서 1회 이상 상담&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">학생경력관리시스템(</span><a href=\"https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: inherit; text-indent: -49.3333px;\">https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr</a><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">)-통합상담-\"진로취업상담\" 상담신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">학생경력관리시스템(</span><a href=\"https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: inherit; text-indent: -49.3333px;\">https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr</a><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">)-하단 바로가기: \"진로취업상담\" 클릭</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -49.3333px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\"></span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -49.3333px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQdkgZAHgQQJ4DkAqAlANgR3gEkBZABXgGUApAewFUAzANwDoAHAOwHMg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -49.3333px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b>대체이수</b>: 학생성공처(대학일자리플러스센터, 취업지원팀, 학생상담센터)에서 진행하는 진로취업 프로그램 수료</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">(</span><u style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">프로그램 안내 시 대체이수 표시)</u><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">2. 주요내용</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;가. 적용대상: 전학년&nbsp;<b>재학생</b>(계약학과, IT융합학과, 외국인유학생 및 시간제등록 학생 제외)</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;나. 개설학기: 1학기<b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 216, 255);\">(2024.3.4. ~ 2024.6.24.)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;다. 수강신청: 별도 수강신청 없음(원스톱서비스에서 수강신청 X)</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;라. 교과목이수:&nbsp;<b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203);\">아래 3개의 방법 중 하나를 선택하여&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203);\">학년별</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203);\">1회</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203);\">&nbsp;상담 권장</span></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;<b>대학일자리플러스센터</b>: 학생경력관리시스템(<a href=\"https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit;\">https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr</a>) 진로취업상담신청-상담진행(개인/집단상담)</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;<b>학생상담센터</b>: 학생상담센터 홈페이지(<a href=\"https://consult.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit;\">https://consult.kumoh.ac.kr</a>), 유선, 방문 신청-상담진행<span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">(개인/집단상담</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;<b>대체이수 프로그램</b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;마. 성적처리: S/U&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;바.&nbsp;<b>성적확인</b>:&nbsp;</span><b style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">2024년 7월 중 이수확인 가능</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp; -</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">원스톱서비스-취업진로상담-취업진로상담이수내역(졸업요건/상담횟수 확인)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;사. 기타:<b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 187, 0);\"> 2024년 8월 졸업예정자</span></b>는<b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 187, 0);\"> 6/24(월)까지 상담 완료</span></b>되어야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">3.&nbsp;<span style=\"text-indent: -37pt;\">문의사항: 054)478-7987</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
